B.ci3=s(["Discover components with list, search, and info before adding code.","Preview broad changes with dry-run before installing a large batch.","Install components in small groups so diffs stay reviewable.","Run doctor after init or whenever registry resolution looks wrong.","Run audit and deps before release to catch drift between your app and the registry.","Commit .shadcn files and installed component files with your app source."],t.s)
