B.b6_=new A.bQ("If the command is not found, add the Dart pub cache bin directory to PATH and restart your shell.",null)
B.b60=new A.bQ("The registry ships with shadcn-inspired palettes and semantic color schemes. Use palettes for custom UI and ColorScheme for component defaults.",null)
B.b62=new A.bQ("Modifiers can be chained to control size, weight, and font family. Example usage is shown below.",null)
B.b63=new A.bQ("Use app-level for global blockers and screen-level for per-screen issues.",null)
B.b64=new A.bQ("Install icon and typography assets on demand, or install everything in one command.",null)
